<!-- Artist Collaboration -->
<section class="artist-collab">
  <div class="artist-collab__inner">
    <div class="artist-collab__text">
      <p class="artist-collab__eyebrow">Artist Collaboration</p>
      <h2>Kaia Mori &times; Bird Three</h2>
      <p>For SS26, Tokyo-based artist Kaia Mori brings her signature blend of organic linework and geometric abstraction to our graphic series. Each piece features original artwork created exclusively for this collection &mdash; exploring themes of flow, tension, and natural rhythm.</p>
      <blockquote>
        &ldquo;I wanted the art to feel like it belongs on the fabric &mdash; not printed on, but woven into the identity of the garment.&rdquo;
        <cite>&mdash; Kaia Mori</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
    <div class="artist-collab__gallery">
      <div class="artist-collab__piece artist-collab__piece--1"></div>
      <div class="artist-collab__piece artist-collab__piece--2"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

